# Freelax

- **Product**: Tax, invoicing, expenses, mileage, and MTD-oriented workflows for UK freelancers.
- **Stack**: Next.js App Router (`app/`), React 18, Tailwind, Radix, Supabase, Stripe.
- **Active branch**: `feat/ui-redesign` — tokenised design system and shared UI primitives.
- **Remote**: `https://github.com/Freelax1/Freelax.git` — use `git` for fetch/push; use `gh` for PRs/issues when authenticated.
- **Scope**: Prefer minimal, design-system-aligned diffs. Do not commit `.env.local` or secrets.
